<Base title="Advertise" description="One featured slot at the top of cannedlatte.com, always labeled Sponsored. Rankings and data are never for sale.">
  <h1>Advertise</h1>
  <p class="lede">One slot, one sponsor at a time.</p>

  <h2>What the slot is</h2>
  <p>A single featured card at the top of the homepage — above the fold on every visit, on the page every reader lands on first. It carries your can, your name and a link wherever you want it to go.</p>

  <h2>What it always carries</h2>
  <p>A visible <strong>Sponsored</strong> label. Not a faint superscript, not a colour change readers have to decode: the word itself, on the card, every time. Readers should never have to wonder which placement was bought.</p>

  <h2>What is never for sale</h2>
  <p>Rankings, data, and list placement. Every ranking on this site is generated from label figures, so no payment moves a can up a list, onto <a href="/best/most-caffeine">most caffeine</a>, or into the top picks. We won't alter a spec, bury an unflattering number, or quietly drop a competitor.</p>
  <p>That's not a courtesy — it's the whole reason the slot is worth buying. A recommendation from a site that sells its rankings isn't worth anything, to you or to the reader.</p>

  <h2>Availability</h2>
  <p>Because it's one slot, it's either open or it isn't. Email <a href="mailto:hello@cannedlatte.com">hello@cannedlatte.com</a> for current availability and rates.</p>
</Base>
